@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain

box Logic LOGIC_COLOR_T1
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":ClientBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":NoteDeleteCommandParser" as NoteDeleteParser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "command:NoteDeleteCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box

box Model MODEL_COLOR_T1
participant "live:Model" as Live MODEL_COLOR
participant "temporary:ModelManager" as Temp MODEL_COLOR
participant "original:Person" as Original MODEL_COLOR
participant "updated:Person" as Updated MODEL_COLOR
end box

box Storage STORAGE_COLOR_T1
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR
end box

[-> Logic : execute("notedelete 1 2")
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : parseCommand(commandText)
activate Parser
Parser -> NoteDeleteParser : parse(arguments)
activate NoteDeleteParser
note right of NoteDeleteParser
Require exactly two positive indices using ParserUtil.parseIndex.
For this command: contactIndex = 1, noteIndex = 2 (one-based).
end note
create Command
NoteDeleteParser -> Command : new NoteDeleteCommand(contactIndex, noteIndex)
NoteDeleteParser --> Parser : command
deactivate NoteDeleteParser
Parser --> Logic : command
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Live : getClientBook(), getUserPrefs()
Live --> Logic : clientBook, userPrefs
create Temp
Logic -> Temp : new ModelManager(clientBook, userPrefs)
Logic -> Live : getFilteredPersonPredicate(), getFilteredPersonComparator()
Live --> Logic : predicate, comparator
Logic -> Temp : updateFilteredPersonList(predicate, comparator)
Logic -> Command : execute(temporary, storage)
activate Command
Command -> Temp : getClientBook().getPersonList()
Temp --> Command : allPersons
note right of Command
Check contactIndex.getZeroBased() against allPersons.size().
Select original = allPersons.get(0), using original full-list index 1.
end note
Command -> Temp : getFilteredPersonList()
Temp --> Command : visiblePersons
note right of Command
Reject if visiblePersons does not contain original.
Filtering and sorting do not change contact indices.
end note
Command -> Original : getInteractionNotes()
Original --> Command : interactionNotes
note right of Command
Copy into notes = new ArrayList<>(interactionNotes).
Check noteIndex.getZeroBased() against notes.size().
Remove deletedNote = notes.remove(1) from the copy.
Both indices are valid on this successful path.
end note
Command -> Original : getName()
Original --> Command : name
note right of Original
Other getters supply phone, email, tags, relationship,
financial fields, next action and both contact preferences.
All unrelated fields and remaining note order are preserved.
end note
create Updated
Command -> Updated : new Person(preserved details, notes,\npreserved next action and preferences)
Command -> Temp : setPerson(original, updated)
note right of Command
Create CommandResult with deleted note index, contact name,
deletedNote.getDate() and excerpt(deletedNote.getText()).
The excerpt collapses whitespace and limits text to 80 code points.
end note
Command --> Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Command
Logic -> Temp : getClientBook()
Temp --> Logic : updatedClientBook
Logic -> Storage : saveClientBook(updatedClientBook)
Storage --> Logic : save completed
note over Logic, Live
Save failure throws CommandException without committing.
The live model and visible UI remain unchanged until a successful save.
end note
Logic -> Logic : commitModel(temporary)
Logic -> Temp : getClientBook()
Temp --> Logic : updatedClientBook
Logic -> Live : setClientBook(updatedClientBook)
Logic -> Temp : getFilteredPersonPredicate(), getFilteredPersonComparator()
Temp --> Logic : predicate, comparator
Logic -> Live : updateFilteredPersonList(predicate, comparator)
note right of Live
The live observable list updates the PersonCard during commit.
The filter and sort remain active; remaining notes are renumbered.
end note
[<-- Logic : CommandResult
deactivate Logic
@enduml
